{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2024-01-07T18:30","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-9026","title":"1月院线：少，烂，好省","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"1月院线看片指南√口√口"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"最为期待\nOur Aspiration!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《大雨》\n7.5\n期待值"},{"text":"01.","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"上映日期：1月12日1第2个周五出品方：今涂影业/导演：不思凡预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房3000万-1亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口念念不忌，天护法。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"在中国动画依托神话IP崛起的今大，有一部动画走出了自己的路，那就是2017年，不思凡导演的《天护法》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"如今，6年过去，在经历了《妙先生》的“失手”之后，不思凡低调地带来了这部新作《大雨》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"画风仍然如前，童趣交杂暗黑，只是《大护法》中所描绘的那个威权、肃杀、人人自危的乌托邦，已经不太可能重现大银幕。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但还是对《大雨》有所期待，因为曾经的《大护法》，也因为不再有《大护法》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"直得关注 —一4部It'sNoteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《夜幕将至》\n将至\n7.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：1月12日1第2个周五出品方：面朝大海/导演：管浩栋","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"豆瓣分7.2（截至目前）／预计票房200-700万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点>又一部平遥系作品登陆大银幕。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"最近两三年，从平遥影展走出的作品登陆大银幕的，不在少数。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"除去魏书钧、孔大山两位小小出圈儿的年轻才俊，其余作品也有《温柔壳》《沉默笔录》《街娃儿》但整体上，它们都属小众，而这部《夜幕将至》，也是如此。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从平遥到院线的距离，这是个有趣的话题。它或许显影看中国的影展电影与普通观众的距离，也可能揭示着中国观众与电影艺术的距离。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"总之，所有距离似乎都在拉开，令人不知所措，进退失据。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《养蜂人》\nEMPIRE\n24\nPREVIEW\nIEXCLUSIVEI\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：1月12日1第2个周五出品方：米拉麦克斯/导演：大卫·阿耶预计豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房3000-8000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点终于轮到替邻居复仇了。删减说明√105分钟，无删减。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看见郭达斯坦森就明白，这片儿没什么可说的，就是打打打、杀杀杀。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"又是一部复仇爽片，而且不是为女儿，也不是为狗，而是为邻居。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"具实所有复仇爽片，满足的都是报应不爽，以及更为底层的，是对于法律、社会秩序、道德和人性的极端不信任。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"它是重刑主义的心理预演，也是“毁灭吧，赶紧的，累了”的厌世情绪的极端爆发。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《回西藏》\n6.0\n期待值。"},{"text":"上唤日期：1月11日1第2个周四","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：山东省委宣传部/导演：陈国星&拉华加预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房100-500万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点最不主旋律的主旋律？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"听说，也只是听说，这部实实的主旋律电影，拍出了非常不同的色彩。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"主演宋洋、金巴，一汉一藏，都是性格演员；导演陈国星、拉华加，同样是汉藏组合，前者曾出主旋律“神作”《横空出世》，后者则是近年来藏地新浪潮的代表人物之一。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片故事同样在讲还一个汉人和一个藏人之间的故事，又名“老孔和久美”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"至于老孔是谁？另一个片名里藏着答案：孔繁森前传。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《出门在外》\n月26日平安回家\n李梦\n顾小曼\n5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：1月26日1第4个周五出品方：宁洋营业/导演：范超&陈一孜预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0／票房800-3000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点胡波御用摄影师的导演首作。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片导演之一范超，是胡波生前亲密的合作者，也是《大象席地而坐》的摄影师。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片是他的长片导演首作。看介绍，是一部犯罪喜剧片，讲一个待业宅男为救被绑架的妹妹，遭遇一连串的荒诞事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"我现在还能回想起来，那年的颁奖典礼现场，华语电影的高光时刻就像一束烟火，聚了又散。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"谨慎观看 ——2部\nPlease Don't Watch"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《临时劫案》\n临 5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：1月19日1第3个周五出品方：银都/导演：麦启光预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点>实在找不到啊。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"也是一部犯罪喜剧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"郭富城演一个牙悍匪，此外还有任贤齐、林家栋、林雪、张可颐等一干港片熟脸儿。剧情大概就是一起抢劫引发的种种阴错阳差的闹剧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看预告片，反正是不抱什么期待。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"1月院线：少，烂，好省 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9026/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《动物园里有什么？》\n5.0\n1月12 期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：1月12日1第2个周五出品方：合力安可/导演：安小满预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房5000万-2亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点看它能有多反智？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看预告片，非常反智，完全不知道这是在干嘛。且，又是一部翻拍。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"有勇气去看这部电影的朋友，回来记得告诉我，“本片翻拍自xXX”的信息，有没有给出，以及放在了哪？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"往常经验显示，只要春节不在1月，那么1月通常就是全年最冷的档期。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"自觉有点竞争力的，要么跑去了贺岁档跨年之前上映），胆儿更肥的，直接扎进春节档，剩在1月里的，通常都是些小片儿。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2024年的1月，止是如此。挑来掠去，只剩四五部电影值得关注。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"总之，量少、质差、省钱。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"稿主笔子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}